      "id": "claim_0f896a2c15634c70b68c02946d78aac0",
      "statement": "The HTTP request handler validates Origin and Host headers before routing any request, including the REST /query and /search endpoints, and rejects a failing request with HTTP 403 and a JSON-RPC error body.",
