      "id": "claim_8ce4c8ef2a1c4223931f9c4f35513baf",
      "statement": "The origin guard accepts a request with no Origin header, but rejects a present Origin unless its hostname is loopback or it matches the explicit origin allowlist, and it recognises loopback as localhost, *.localhost, ::1, IPv4-mapped loopback, and 127.0.0.0/8 while excluding 0.0.0.0.",
      "evidence": [
