    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0a991beb0df74beab57320dfd353d5b3",
      "statement": "Host header enforcement is on for a concrete bind address and off for a wildcard bind unless an explicit host allowlist is supplied; a concrete non-loopback bind address is added to the accepted hosts, and QMD_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=* disables all origin and host checks.",
