      "statement": "Trust approvals are stored in trusted.json keyed by the resolved config path and hold an order-independent SHA-256 digest of the gated surface, so reordering collections keeps an approval while editing a hook, moving a path outside the project, or changing a custom model URI re-arms the gate.",
