      "id": "claim_543f1e65b878434d9d892ba9eb2118d1",
      "statement": "Vectors live in one vec0 table partitioned by an integer collection_id, with a vector_rows table mapping each rowid to (hash, seq, collection_id) and a vector_collection_ids table mapping names to ids, so renaming a collection updates one id row and does not rewrite vectors.",
